I'm sorry, a point of clarification to the last sentence

All,

IPP does not claim conformance to ASTM or AWWA fitting standards for flange=
 adapters in sizes 26" and up, nor for MJ adapters in any size.

You may propose using them by re-citing in your quote what IPP claims: "PE4=
710 adapters meet dimensional requirements of ASTM D3261 and AWWA C906".

When any ASTM or AWWA fitting standard is required by a customer in a quote=
 request or PO, IPP flanges 26" and larger or MJ adapters in any size are n=
ot an option for us.


--_000_dd2d497a65c94082bf82f6c5e3ca36b1harcofittingscom_
